# SmartTracking environment variables.
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and adjust values.
# `make run` auto-loads `.env` before starting the dev server + MCP server.

# Shared bearer token for the JSON REST API (tracking/api.py).
# Clients authenticate with: Authorization: Bearer <token>
# Also used by the bundled MCP server (mcp_server.py) to call the REST API.
# Leave empty to disable token auth (API then only accepts logged-in sessions).
TRACKING_API_TOKEN=change-me

# MCP server (started by `make run`, see mcp_server.md). Defaults shown.
# SMARTTRACKING_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8092
# MCP_HOST=127.0.0.1
# MCP_PORT=8091

